title: "soundscapy"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python package for soundscape engineering: ISO 12913 survey analysis,
  psychoacoustic analysis of calibrated recordings, predictive modelling of soundscape
  perception, and scoring and design with the Soundscape Perception Index (SPI).
type: software
authors:
